},
{
"k": "13346",
"who": "THE \"WALK-N-SEARCH\" PART OF THE SCENE, WHERE YOU'RE HUNTING FOR THE BOOK, HAS GEORGIE RAMPING UP THROUGH THREE STATES OF DISTRESS",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "1) At first he is arrogant, amused, careless\n2) After you destroy one object, he is angry, protesting, making threats"
},
{
"k": "13347",
"who": "<<ID",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "357249793>>1) At first he is arrogant, amused, careless\n2) After you destroy one object, he is angry, protesting, making threats"
},
{
"k": "13348",
"who": "THE APPOINTMENT BOOK IS HIDDEN IN A FLOOR SAFE, BELOW A WALL WITH A PAINTED MERMAID.  YOU CAN FIND THE SAFE A FEW DIFFERENT WAYS",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "--if you destroy a bunch of stuff, Georgie will crack and tell you where to find the appointment book.\n--if you break open the file cabinet in the dressing room, you can"
},
{
"k": "13349",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Oh!  Sorry… we're closed right now."
},
{
"k": "13350",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I'm a friend of Georgie's."
},
{
"k": "13351",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[slightly amused, but she'll let him get away with it]A friend, huh?"
},
{
"k": "13352",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkinga}I'm a friend of Georgie's. Where is he?"
},
{
"k": "13353",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[she guesses who]Georgie."
},
{
"k": "13354",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkinga}I'm looking for someone."
},
{
"k": "13355",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkingb}I've got some questions for Georgie."
},
{
"k": "13356",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I'm guessing that withering stare is actually meant for Georgie, yeah?"
},
{
"k": "13357",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You're in luck, he's here. Come on."
},
{
"k": "13358",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You want to talk to Georgie, don't you?"
},
{
"k": "13359",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[she does understand what he wants]Yes, of course. You'd better talk to Georgie."
},
{
"k": "13360",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I think I'd remember an appointment with the Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "13361",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Good.  We have business."
},
{
"k": "13362",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Ah."
},
{
"k": "13363",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I didn't make one."
},
{
"k": "13364",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I mean, more so than usual."
},
{
"k": "13365",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "But it's just worse now."
},
{
"k": "13366",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "And he's in kind of a… mood right now."
},
{
"k": "13367",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I have a way with people."
},
{
"k": "13368",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Anything I should know before I go in there?"
},
{
"k": "13369",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Oh my god!"
},
{
"k": "13370",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "He's working with one of the dancers.  But don't worry about that. Discretion is our guarantee."
},
{
"k": "13371",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkingb}Is he alone in there?"
},
{
"k": "13372",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Hey umm…"
},
{
"k": "13373",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Not really.  She was weekends and the Wednesday shift, I think."
},
{
"k": "13374",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Vivian.  I'm actually here investigating a murder."
},
{
"k": "13375",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Vivian."
},
{
"k": "13376",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "And I'm Vivian, by the way."
},
{
"k": "13377",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "It's Vivian, by the way."
},
{
"k": "13378",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You're always welcome, of course."
},
{
"k": "13379",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[frustrated and bored]Smile.  SMILE.  Fuuuuuck…. How many times I gotta tell you?   SMILE.   Your face…"
},
{
"k": "13380",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "This is why you've never headlined for me, and why you never will…"
},
{
"k": "13381",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Oy, Christ, I'm trying to muster even the bat-squeak whisper of a give-a-fuck right now…"
},
{
"k": "13382",
"who": "MUSIC",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Heavy booty rockin' strip club music, coming from the boom box.  Give appropriate reverb and volume ramp-up to suggest the directionality here."
},
{
"k": "13383",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}I don't much care how he feels about it."
},
{
"k": "13384",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Ah.  Well.  You two will get along just swimmingly."
},
{
"k": "13385",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Vivian.  Did you, uh, know a girl named Lily?"
},
{
"k": "13386",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[awkward.]Anyway. I'm Vivian…"
},
{
"k": "13387",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Then again, maybe he's not the only one.[…who is in a bad mood]"
},
{
"k": "13388",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "And by the way, I'm Vivian.  Without assuming you give a shit."
},
{
"k": "13389",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "And I'm Vivian, since you didn't ask."
},
{
"k": "13390",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I need to ask some questions."
},
{
"k": "13391",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Hans, is it?"
},
{
"k": "13392",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[loud, over music]Who the fuck?"
},
{
"k": "13393",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I need to ask you a few questions."
},
{
"k": "13394",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Got a minute to talk?"
},
{
"k": "13395",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{AngryA}What the fuck?"
},
{
"k": "13396",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{AngryA}Get your hand off my shit."
},
{
"k": "13397",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You Georgie?"
},
{
"k": "13398",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{AnnoyedA}[annoyed and dismissive, coming down off of the \"What the fuck?\"]Oh.  It's you."
},
{
"k": "13399",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[loud, over music]Hey."
},
{
"k": "13400",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}What do you want, then?  {EvilA}You here for a little taste?"
},
{
"k": "13401",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Didn't ask you."
},
{
"k": "13402",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "He was-"
},
{
"k": "13403",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}[to Nerissa]You stay right there, don't even think about sitting down."
},
{
"k": "13404",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{doubtfula}You Georgie?"
},
{
"k": "13405",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You got me, copper.  Dead to rights."
},
{
"k": "13406",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}[bored]Brilliant deduction, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "13407",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkingb}I got a few questions."
},
{
"k": "13408",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}[bored, looking away]Imagine my excitement."
},
{
"k": "13409",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}Leave her alone, asshole."
},
{
"k": "13410",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{DefensiveA}[bored]Sure.  Whatever you say."
},
{
"k": "13411",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I let him in.  He says he has a few questions for you."
},
{
"k": "13412",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[to Bigby]How'd you get in my club?"
},
{
"k": "13413",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[ironic]Great."
},
{
"k": "13414",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Did my best."
},
{
"k": "13415",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[trying to convince him]Five minutes.  C'mon, it won't kill you."
},
{
"k": "13416",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[annoyed]I thought you said he had questions."
},
{
"k": "13417",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[confused as to why you're being silent, at a loss]Um…"
},
{
"k": "13418",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}Tell you what, come back after midnight, maybe.  I can hook you up."
},
{
"k": "13419",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{annoyeda}Or… knowing you… she's probably not quite your style."
},
{
"k": "13420",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Your reputation precedes you, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "13421",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}[laughing, then mock imitating Bigby]Oh, \"I'm not here for that!\"  {annoyeda}[laugh]Just stopped in for the chips?"
},
{
"k": "13422",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{thinkingb}I'm not here for that."
},
{
"k": "13423",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{defensivea}Jesus, Bigby.  You are so [hit]corny.  {evila}I love it, though.  No, seriously I love it."
},
{
"k": "13424",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}Fuck you, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "13425",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}[laughing, then mock imitating Bigby]\"Fuck you, Georgie.\"  {evila}Grrr!  It's the Big Bad Wolf!"
},
{
"k": "13426",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}You don't know me."
},
{
"k": "13427",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}[laughing, then mock imitating Bigby]\"You don't know me!\"  {evila}Okay.  Mysterious lone wolf, right, I gotcha."
},
{
"k": "13428",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{cockya}[mocking Bigby with a big cigarette inhale]None of that, Georgie, I'd rather just strike a macho pose for a moment."
},
{
"k": "13429",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{defensivea}Okay, alright, Sheriff.  Just fucking with you."
},
{
"k": "13430",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "So if you're not here for fun… then why are you in my club?"
},
{
"k": "13431",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Something happened…"
},
{
"k": "13432",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I'm here about Lily."
},
{
"k": "13433",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I'M the one asking the questions."
},
{
"k": "13434",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Look, something happened to one of your… employees last night."
},
{
"k": "13435",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "[serious, not ironic, undertone of anger]Yeah.  Lily.  I know already."
},
{
"k": "13436",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Yeah… I should probably tell you… I know already."
},
{
"k": "13437",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Oh shit, he's serious."
},
{
"k": "13438",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "I'M the one asking the questions here, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "13439",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Look, Bigby… just, enough with the tough-guy bullshit.  I know why you're here.  I already know."
},
{
"k": "13440",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "How the hell do you \"know\" already?  Who told you?"
},
{
"k": "13441",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Lemme explain something, Sheriff.  Around here we don't expect a lot from you or your poncey downtown friends. We fend for ourselves."
},
{
"k": "13442",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "When shit happens, I hear about it, especially if it concerns my livelihood."
},
{
"k": "13443",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{doubtfula}In that case I assume you knew Lily was glamoured."
},
{
"k": "13444",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}Of course she was, you daft git.  She was a troll."
},
{
"k": "13445",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}No.  I mean glamoured to look like another Fable."
},
{
"k": "13446",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "What? Bollocks. Who?"
},
{
"k": "13447",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "Come on, Bigby, give over, who was she drumming up as?"
},
{
"k": "13448",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}It's sick."
},
{
"k": "13449",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "It's illegal."
},
{
"k": "13450",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You're behind it."
},
{
"k": "13451",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{evila}Hah! That's quaint. Especially coming from you."
},
{
"k": "13452",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "You're the one who hears things, you tell me."
},
{
"k": "13453",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "That probably sounded cooler in your head."
},
{
"k": "13454",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}It's illegal, {angryb}as long as I don't like it."
},
{
"k": "13455",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{angrya}You know it's illegal to impersonate another Fable."
},
{
"k": "13456",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{annoyeda}[correcting him]It's FROWNED ON."
},
{
"k": "13457",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{annoyeda}[making fun of him]Is this some great strategy to get me to incriminate myself? Brilliant."
},
{
"k": "13458",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_puddinpie",
"en": "{annoyeda}This is exactly what I would expect from a thug like you.  {DefensiveA}Storm in, throw around a bunch of accusations, try to scare people, {angrya}but you've got fuck all to back it up.    Pfft."
